        "target_sha256": "8675f7aab745b33e1e4875e831052ad6007caee697004f3cfabe4eb00495fb32"
      },
      {
        "key": "gsm8k-train-1414:new_record",
        "raw_call_sha256": "b7a1c6b9375feb251f841ce740c54e43deae46b63d04605e0af18edf87699d7c",
        "student_prefix": [
          {
            "content": "Stacy just bought a 6 month prescription of flea & tick medicine for her dog for $150.00 online.  Her cashback app was offering 10% cashback and she has a mail-in rebate for $25.00 on a 6-month prescription.  How much will the medicine cost after cash back and rebate offers?",
            "role": "user"
          },
          {
            "content": "The initial cost of the flea & tick medicine is $150.00. Stacy's cashback app offers 10% cashback, which means she will get back 10% of $150.00. To calculate the cashback amount: \n\n\\[ \\text{Cashback} = 150.00 \\times 0.10 = 15.00 \\]\n\nAfter applying the cashback, the cost of the medicine is:\n\n\\[ \\text{Cost after cashback} = 150.00 - 15.00 = 135.00 \\]\n\nNext, Stacy has a mail-in rebate for $25.00. Subtracting this rebate from the cost after cashback:\n\n\\[ \\text{Final cost} = 135.00 - 25.00 = 110.00 \\]\n\nFINAL: 110.00",
            "role": "assistant"
          },
          {
            "content": "Write your own reusable record of this solved task.",
            "role": "user"
          }
        ],
        "student_prefix_sha256": "57389e1168de41ae94ef4c460bae86479917526a92a63d110e85b13f2a2db10c",
        "target": "Given the problem, I identified the initial cost of the flea & tick medicine as $150.00. I also noted the cashback offer of 10% and the mail-in rebate of $25.00. My task was to determine the final cost after applying both the cashback and the rebate.\n\nFirst, I calculated the cashback amount by taking 10% of $150.00:\n\\[ \\text{Cashback} = 150.00 \\times 0.10 = 15.00 \\]\nThis means Stacy would receive $15.00 back, reducing the initial cost.\n\nNext, I subtracted the cashback from the initial cost to find the new total:\n\\[ \\text{Cost after cashback} = 150.00 - 15.00 = 135.00 \\]\n\nThen, I applied the mail-in rebate of $25.00 to the cost after cashback:\n\\[ \\text{Final cost} = 135.00 - 25.00 = 110.00 \\]\n\nTo verify the result, I checked each step:\n1. The cashback calculation was correct because 10% of $150.00 is indeed $15.00.\n2. Subtracting $15.00 from $150.00 correctly gives $135.00.\n3. Subtracting $25.00 from $135.00 correctly gives $110.00.\n\nThe operations I used were straightforward percentage calculation and subtraction, which I can reuse in similar problems involving discounts and rebates.\n\nFINAL: 110.00",
        "target_sha256": "52f7b5fd53191a7ceea1e9d83cb1c46c872470900da93f3a08163a05c3991ff6"
      }
